   "isMock": true,
   "text": "设当 \\(x\\to0\\) 时，有 \\(\\cot x=\\frac{1+ax^{2}}{x+bx^{3}}+o(x^{5})\\)，则（　）\nA. \\(a=\\frac{2}{5},\\ b=-\\frac{1}{15}\\)\nB. \\(a=-\\frac{2}{5},\\ b=\\frac{1}{15}\\)\nC. \\(a=-\\frac{2}{5},\\ b=-\\frac{1}{15}\\)\nD. \\(a=\\frac{2}{5},\\ b=\\frac{1}{15}\\)",
   "answer": "\\(C\\)",
   "steps": [
    "\\(\\cot x=\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}=\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{x}{3}-\\frac{x^{3}}{45}-\\frac{2x^{5}}{945}-\\cdots\\)。",
    "将右端有理式展开：\\(\\frac{1+ax^{2}}{x+bx^{3}}=\\frac{1}{x}(1+ax^{2})(1-bx^{2}+b^{2}x^{4}-\\cdots)\\)。",
    "乘开得 \\(\\frac{1}{x}+(a-b)x+(b^{2}-ab)x^{3}+(ab^{2}-b^{3})x^{5}+\\cdots\\)。",
    "比较 \\(x\\) 项与 \\(x^{3}\\) 项系数：\\(a-b=-\\frac{1}{3}\\)，\\(b^{2}-ab=-\\frac{1}{45}\\)。",
    "第二式即 \\(b(b-a)=-\\frac{1}{45}\\)，与 \\(a-b=-\\frac{1}{3}\\) 联立：\\(-b\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}=-\\frac{1}{45}\\)，得 \\(b=-\\frac{1}{15}\\)，从而 \\(a=b-\\frac{1}{3}=-\\frac{2}{5}\\)。",
    "（原卷写 \\(o(x^{5})\\)，但两项有理式在 \\(x^{5}\\) 项上不能与 \\(\\cot x\\) 完全吻合，故按 \\(x\\)、\\(x^{3}\\) 项系数匹配确定 \\(a,b\\)；四个选项仅在符号上不同，选 C。）"
   ],
