   "id": "math-mock-0-5-7",
   "subject": "math",
   "chapter": "math-mock-0-5",
   "chapterTitle": "2026 李林六套卷（数一）（第5套）",
   "kp": "",
   "kpName": "第7题（选择题）",
   "kind": "选择题",
   "difficulty": "中",
   "year": "2026",
   "source": "2026 李林六套卷（数一）（第5套）",
   "isReal": true,
   "isMock": true,
   "text": "设 \\(n\\) 阶非零实矩阵 \\(A\\) 满足 \\(A^{T}+A=O\\)，\\(B\\) 为 \\(n\\) 阶矩阵，矩阵 \\(\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ -B&B\\end{pmatrix}\\)、\\(\\begin{pmatrix}A-E&O\\\\ A&AB\\end{pmatrix}\\)、\\(\\begin{pmatrix}A+E&O\\\\ B&A-E\\end{pmatrix}\\) 的秩依次为 \\(r_{1},r_{2},r_{3}\\)，则（　）\nA. \\(r_{1}\\ge r_{2}\\ge r_{3}\\)\nB. \\(r_{3}\\ge r_{2}\\ge r_{1}\\)\nC. \\(r_{2}\\ge r_{1}\\ge r_{3}\\)\nD. \\(r_{3}\\ge r_{1}\\ge r_{2}\\)",
   "answer": "\\(D\\)",
   "steps": [
    "\\(A^{T}=-A\\)。对任意 \\(x\\)，\\(x^{T}Ax=(x^{T}Ax)^{T}=x^{T}A^{T}x=-x^{T}Ax\\)，故 \\(x^{T}Ax=0\\)。",
    "若 \\((A-E)x=0\\)，则 \\(Ax=x\\)，左乘 \\(x^{T}\\) 得 \\(x^{T}x=x^{T}Ax=0\\)，\\(x=0\\)，故 \\(A-E\\) 可逆；同理 \\((A+E)x=0\\) 给出 \\(Ax=-x\\)，\\(x^{T}x=-x^{T}Ax=0\\)，\\(A+E\\) 可逆。",
    "于是 \\(r_{3}=\\mathrm{rank}(A+E)+\\mathrm{rank}(A-E)=n+n=2n\\)。",
    "第二个矩阵为下三角分块，\\(r_{2}=\\mathrm{rank}(A-E)+\\mathrm{rank}(AB)=n+\\mathrm{rank}(AB)\\)。",
    "第一个矩阵分解：\\(\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ -B&B\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}E&O\\\\ O&B\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ -E&E\\end{pmatrix}\\)，而后一因子行列式 \\(|A+E|\\ne0\\)，可逆。",
    "故 \\(r_{1}=\\mathrm{rank}\\begin{pmatrix}E&O\\\\ O&B\\end{pmatrix}=n+\\mathrm{rank}B\\)。",
    "由 \\(\\mathrm{rank}(AB)\\le\\mathrm{rank}B\\) 得 \\(r_{2}=n+\\mathrm{rank}(AB)\\le n+\\mathrm{rank}B=r_{1}\\)；又 \\(\\mathrm{rank}B\\le n\\)，得 \\(r_{1}\\le2n=r_{3}\\)。所以 \\(r_{3}\\ge r_{1}\\ge r_{2}\\)，选 D。"
   ],
