    "由 \\(\\varphi''(t)=g''(t)-2K=f''(t)-2K\\) 得 \\(K=\\frac{f''(\\xi)}{2}\\)，即 \\(g(x)=\\frac{f''(\\xi)}{2}(x-a)(x-b)\\)。",
